<title>BELGIUM: Boeing decision still set for July 23, EU says.</title>
<headline>Boeing decision still set for July 23, EU says.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS, Belgium</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said Monday that July 23 remained its target date for a decision on whether to clear Boeing Co.'s planned merger with McDonnell Douglas Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;According to all appearances, the 23rd of July is the date,&quot; a spokesman said in response to reporters' questions.</p>
<p>His remarks follow a unanimous decision Friday by national competition officials in the 15 EU states to back the commission's recommendation to block the planned merger in its current form.</p>
</text>
